{
  "id": "6acf78550a7bb2a90457f72f",
  "title": "改行記法（br.iconをCSSで描画するUserCSS）",
  "created": 1791981654,
  "updated": 1791982865,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6acf78550a7bb2a90457f72f",
      "text": "改行記法（br.iconをCSSで描画するUserCSS）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791981654,
      "updated": 1791982321
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef00000000008810fd",
      "text": "[UserCSS.icon] [UserScript.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef00000000008810fe",
      "text": " 書式：[br].icon（[アイコン]記法）",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7b4a0000000000881132",
      "text": " 製作者：[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982410,
      "updated": 1791982498
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef00000000008810ff",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef0000000000881100",
      "text": "記法や[テーブル]のセル、[箇条書き]の任意の位置で[改行]することができる",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef0000000000881101",
      "text": "\t箇条書き[br.icon]箇条書き",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef0000000000881102",
      "text": "\t[[strong[br.icon]-strong]]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef0000000000881103",
      "text": "table: ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef0000000000881104",
      "text": " セル[br.icon]セル",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef0000000000881105",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef0000000000881107",
      "text": " code:style.css",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef0000000000881108",
      "text": "  a.icon[href$=\"/br\"]:not(.cursor-line *) {",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef0000000000881109",
      "text": "  \tdisplay: block !important;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef000000000088110a",
      "text": "  \tmax-width: 0px !important; height: 0px !important;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef000000000088110b",
      "text": "  \topacity: 0;",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef000000000088110c",
      "text": "  }",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef000000000088110d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef000000000088110e",
      "text": "[Popup Menu にボタンを追加するUserScript]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef000000000088110f",
      "text": "\tcode:script.js",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef0000000000881110",
      "text": "\t\tscrapbox.PopupMenu.addButton({",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef0000000000881111",
      "text": "  \ttitle: '改行アイコンを挿入',",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef0000000000881112",
      "text": "  \tonClick: text => text.split('\\n').map(line => `[br.icon]${line}`).join('\\n')",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef0000000000881113",
      "text": "  })",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef0000000000881114",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef0000000000881115",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982319
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef0000000000881116",
      "text": "#記法UserCSS",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982346
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7aef0000000000881118",
      "text": "[2026-10-14] ",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982319,
      "updated": 1791982865
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7b80000000000088114d",
      "text": " Settingsに導入",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1791982464,
      "updated": 1791982471
    },
    {
      "id": "6acf7b1c000000000088112e",
      "text": "\tfrom [/customize/改行記法（br.iconをCSSで描画するUserCSS）], [/nrem-configs/改行記法（br.iconをCSSで描画するUserCSS）]",
